        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Istanbul, Turkey, Beyazıt Square, Tophane, Beyoğlu, Forum of Theodosius, ancient Constantinople\n- Organizations: Bayezid II Mosque, Nusretiye Mosque\n\nFacts:\n- Bayezid II Mosque is an Ottoman imperial mosque in the Beyazıt Square area of Istanbul, Turkey.\n- Bayezid II Mosque is near the ruins of the Forum of Theodosius of ancient Constantinople.\n- Bayezid II Mosque is also referred to in Turkish as Beyazıt Camii and Bayezid Camii.\n- Nusretiye Mosque is an ornate mosque in the Tophane district of Beyoğlu, Istanbul, Turkey.",
